{"id":"n32204-1-20","stage":1,"title":"가을 · 秋天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32204-1-20-1","ko":"요즘은 아침저녁으로 서늘한 바람이 부네.","zh":"最近早晚的风都挺凉的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침저녁으로","meaning":"早晚，朝夕","explanation":"아침저녁：早晚，朝夕；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"아침저녁","audio":"/audio/152d068cd58c4898cefd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93384","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서늘한","meaning":"凉，凉爽","explanation":"서늘하다：凉，凉爽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"서늘하다","audio":"/audio/839cbf28fd9b94c982a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16241","senseId":"1","lemma":"서늘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부네.","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"152d068cd58c4898","term":"아침저녁","zh":"早晚，朝夕","audio":"/audio/152d068cd58c4898cefd.mp3","entryId":"93384","definition":"早上和晚上。","pronunciation":["아침저녁"]},{"id":"839cbf28fd9b94c9","term":"서늘하다","zh":"凉，凉爽","audio":"/audio/839cbf28fd9b94c982a0.mp3","entryId":"16241","definition":"温度略显冷或气温低。","pronunciation":["서늘하다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01eafa8afd6f1fce58ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32204-1-20-2","ko":"팔월도 다 지나갔으니 곧 가을이 오려나 봐.","zh":"八月也快过去了，看来秋天就要来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"팔월도","meaning":"八月","explanation":"팔월：八月；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"팔월","audio":"/audio/fe4ed11251c4f55b49de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30188","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나갔으니","meaning":"经过，度过","explanation":"지나가다：经过，度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"3","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오려나","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；려나：表示对未来情况的疑问或推测。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe4ed11251c4f55b","term":"팔월","zh":"八月","audio":"/audio/fe4ed11251c4f55b49de.mp3","entryId":"30188","definition":"一年十二个月中的第八个月。","pronunciation":["파뤌"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"经过，度过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"随着时间流逝，某个时期结束。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06ffe0c9f9e012326e26.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32204","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":1.9772,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近早晚的风都挺凉的。","八月也快过去了，看来秋天就要来了。","马上就要考试了，还这么沉迷游戏，要怎么办啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近早晚的风都挺凉的。","八月也快过去了，看来秋天就要来了。","马上就要考试了，还这么沉迷游戏，要怎么办啊？"],"answer":1}]}
